        "created_at": "2016-10-03T02:44:29.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>Here’s a weird one!</p>\n<p>Suppose Imbued Vitality is in play, along with the Durasteel Chains. At the end of the the Villain turn, my last Southwest Sentinel gets incapacitated, flipping over.</p>\n<p>The Sentinels rule card says, “If you have no hero targets in play, flip this card.”</p>\n<p>I think my animated chains should totally let me stay in the game until I can play that Second Chance in my hand. Otherwise, I would sort of be incapacitated but have no incapacitated abilities. Right?</p>",
        "post_number": 1,
        "post_type": 1,
        "updated_at": "2021-02-07T01:48:14.224Z",
        "reply_count": 0,
        "reply_to_post_number": null,
