        "raw": "Here's a weird one! \r\n\r\n\r\nSuppose Imbued Vitality is in play, along with the Durasteel Chains. At the end of the the Villain turn, my last Southwest Sentinel gets incapacitated, flipping over.\r\n\r\n\r\nThe Sentinels rule card says, \"If you have no hero targets in play, flip this card.\" \r\n\r\n\r\n\r\nI think my animated chains should totally let me stay in the game until I can play that Second Chance in my hand. Otherwise, I would sort of be incapacitated but have no incapacitated abilities. Right?",
